  "description": "Young Alice Estevan has a secret. She was actually reborn in \"The Tyrant's Silver Flower,\" a hardcore, tragic BL where she'll be killed for abusing the male leads! Luckily, she still has time to avoid that fate by liberating Edwin, one of the male leads, from the tower he's trapped in. And though she succeeds in getting the key to free the boy, there's just one problem: he hates her guts! With the threat of death looming ever so closer, will Alice win Edwin over and earn her happy ending? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
